flowchart TD
    Start([Payment Stuck in Pending]) --> CheckAge{How long<br/>in pending?}

    CheckAge -->|< 2 min| Normal[Normal<br/>Wait for webhook]
    CheckAge -->|2-5 min| Investigate[Begin investigation]
    CheckAge -->|> 5 min| Critical[Critical issue<br/>Immediate action]

    Investigate --> QueryLND[Query Lightning Node:<br/>lncli lookupinvoice]
    Critical --> QueryLND

    QueryLND --> LNDResponse{LND invoice<br/>status?}

    LNDResponse -->|SETTLED| WebhookMissed[Webhook was missed]
    LNDResponse -->|OPEN/ACCEPTED| StillPending[Actually still pending]
    LNDResponse -->|CANCELED/EXPIRED| Failed[Payment failed]
    LNDResponse -->|Error/Timeout| NodeIssue[LND node issue]

    WebhookMissed --> CheckWebhookLogs[Check webhook<br/>delivery logs]
    CheckWebhookLogs --> WebhookFound{Webhook in logs?}

    WebhookFound -->|Yes, processed| DBIssue[Database update failed]
    WebhookFound -->|Yes, rejected| SigIssue[Signature verification<br/>failed]
    WebhookFound -->|No| ProviderIssue[Provider didn't<br/>send webhook]

    DBIssue --> CheckLocks[Check for<br/>database locks]
    CheckLocks --> HasLock{Lock found?}
    HasLock -->|Yes| TerminateLock[Terminate blocking<br/>query]
    HasLock -->|No| ManualUpdate1[Manual DB update<br/>to completed]

    SigIssue --> VerifySecret[Verify webhook<br/>secret matches]
    VerifySecret --> SecretOK{Secret correct?}
    SecretOK -->|No| UpdateSecret[Update webhook<br/>secret]
    SecretOK -->|Yes| CheckTimestamp[Check timestamp<br/>tolerance]

    ProviderIssue --> RetriggerWebhook[Contact provider to<br/>retrigger webhook]
    RetriggerWebhook --> ManualUpdate2[Or manual DB<br/>update]

    StillPending --> CheckUser{Did user<br/>complete payment?}
    CheckUser -->|Unknown| ContactUser[Contact user to<br/>verify]
    CheckUser -->|Yes| InvestigateRouting[Investigate Lightning<br/>routing issue]
    CheckUser -->|No| WaitOrExpire[Wait or mark<br/>as expired]

    InvestigateRouting --> CheckChannels[Check channel<br/>liquidity]
    CheckChannels --> LiquidityOK{Sufficient<br/>liquidity?}
    LiquidityOK -->|No| AddLiquidity[Add inbound<br/>liquidity]
    LiquidityOK -->|Yes| RoutingProblem[Lightning network<br/>routing problem]

    Failed --> MarkFailed[Update DB status<br/>to 'failed']
    MarkFailed --> NotifyUser1[Notify user payment<br/>failed]

    NodeIssue --> RestartLND[Restart LND node]
    RestartLND --> WaitSync[Wait for sync<br/>5-10 minutes]
    WaitSync --> RetryQuery[Retry invoice<br/>lookup]

    TerminateLock --> ManualUpdate1
    UpdateSecret --> ManualUpdate1
    CheckTimestamp --> ManualUpdate1
    ManualUpdate2 --> UpdateDB[Update payment<br/>to completed]
    ManualUpdate1 --> UpdateDB

    UpdateDB --> TriggerConfirmation[Trigger post-payment<br/>webhooks]
    TriggerConfirmation --> NotifyUser2[Notify user payment<br/>confirmed]

    WaitOrExpire --> SetExpiry[Set expiry time<br/>if not set]
    AddLiquidity --> MonitorPayment[Monitor payment<br/>for settlement]
    RoutingProblem --> DocumentIssue[Document routing<br/>issue]

    NotifyUser1 --> LogIncident[Log incident for<br/>analysis]
    NotifyUser2 --> LogSuccess[Log successful<br/>recovery]
    DocumentIssue --> LogIncident
    MonitorPayment --> LogSuccess
    SetExpiry --> LogSuccess

    LogIncident --> End([Investigation Complete])
    LogSuccess --> End

    style Start fill:#1e40af,stroke:#3b82f6,color:#fff
    style Critical fill:#dc2626,stroke:#ef4444,color:#fff
    style WebhookMissed fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#fbbf24,color:#000
    style Failed fill:#dc2626,stroke:#ef4444,color:#fff
    style NodeIssue fill:#dc2626,stroke:#ef4444,color:#fff
    style UpdateDB fill:#059669,stroke:#10b981,color:#fff
    style NotifyUser2 fill:#059669,stroke:#10b981,color:#fff
    style End fill:#7c3aed,stroke:#8b5cf6,color:#fff
